every command we fire in terminal is received by shell

all users in linux will have their default shell
how to check : echo $SHELL
SHELL is an environment variable that shows default shell of current user
you can check it in /etc/passwd
you can change their default shell there and put new shell

to change the shell temporarily, write the shell name

